# Convex agent skills are installed twice — once into .claude/ for Claude Code and
# once into .agents/ for the generic convention. We only use the former, so the
# duplicate is ignored. Regenerate either with `npx convex ai-files install`.
.agents/

# Convex
# Note: convex/_generated/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Committing it keeps
# `npm run build` and a fresh clone typechecking without running the Convex CLI
# first. Convex regenerates it on every dev/deploy anyway.
# The deployment URL and dev deploy key live in .env.local, covered by .env.* above.
